# ---- Frontend environment (Vite). Only variables starting with VITE_ reach the browser: never put secrets here. ----
#
# LOCAL development: leave VITE_API_URL unset. `npm run dev` forwards /api to the backend on http://127.0.0.1:8000.
#
# PRODUCTION (Vercel -> Project Settings -> Environment Variables), for Production AND Preview:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://smart-device-forcast-1.onrender.com
# (no trailing slash and no "/api": the code adds "/api/..." itself). Vite bakes this in at BUILD time, so after changing it
# you must redeploy on Vercel.
# VITE_API_URL=
